  "notes": [
   "The single 18-unit choice spans two printed subheadings, 'Physical Science Courses' (ASTR through PHYS 499) and 'Biological Science Courses' (ANTH through PSYC 311); recorded as one choose_units block.",
   "Footnote 1: the 18 units must be transfer-level and must include one laboratory course in a physical science and one laboratory course in a biological science.",
   "Closed-list codes NATR306 and NATR324 (no space) matched to catalog NATR 306 and NATR 324.",
